<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Alpha Biomes' glowstool (AB_Glowstool) is retired in favour of vanilla's Glowstool: the Mycotic Jungle spawns vanilla
		Glowstool at the same weight (3), vanilla Glowstool is made to grow in any light (no longer cave-only or killed by
		light) so it can live on the jungle's surface, and AB_Glowstool goes on this mod's Cherry Picker list. With
		Progression: Agriculture, its glowstool seed bundle and the two recipes that make it are retired too.
		Note the light change applies to vanilla Glowstool everywhere, not just in the jungle.
		This folder only loads when Alpha Biomes is active (see loadFolders.xml); the Progression gate sits on an <li>.

		Verified against Alpha Biomes 1.6: the Mycotic Jungle lists AB_Glowstool (3) and not vanilla Glowstool, and vanilla
		Glowstool's own plant node has none of the four fields added, so the add creates them. VPE Mushrooms also adds
		AB_Glowstool to its mushroom sow tags; that still applies, it just no longer matters once the def is cherry-picked.
		The revive entries are in 1.6/Defs/CherryPicker.xml.

		Progression: Agriculture makes the same biome swap itself when VFE Medieval 2 is also loaded (its Alpha Biomes patch,
		plus a ReplaceLib replacer). So the biome swap is a Conditional that only runs while AB_Glowstool is still listed,
		and the other operations are separate from it, so the light change and cherry-picks still apply when Progression
		got there first. Before this, the failed swap stopped the whole sequence (seen in a full load on 2026-09-29).
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>Defs/BiomeDef[defName="AB_MycoticJungle"]/wildPlants/AB_Glowstool</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
			<xpath>Defs/BiomeDef[defName="AB_MycoticJungle"]/wildPlants/AB_Glowstool</xpath>
			<value>
				<Glowstool>3</Glowstool>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence">
		<operations>
			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
				<xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Glowstool"]/plant</xpath>
				<value>
					<growMinGlow>0</growMinGlow>
					<growOptimalGlow>0</growOptimalGlow>
					<cavePlant>false</cavePlant>
					<diesToLight>false</diesToLight>
				</value>
			</li>
			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
				<xpath>Defs/CherryPicker.DefList[defName="MMMM_ConvergenceOther_CherryPicker_Basics"]/defs</xpath>
				<value>
					<li>ThingDef/AB_Glowstool</li>
				</value>
			</li>

			<li Class="PatchOperationSequence" MayRequire="ferny.progressionagriculture">
				<operations>
					<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
						<xpath>Defs/CherryPicker.DefList[defName="MMMM_ConvergenceOther_CherryPicker_Basics"]/defs</xpath>
						<value>
							<li>ThingDef/AB_Glowstool_SeedBundle</li>
							<li>RecipeDef/MakeAB_GlowstoolSeedBundle</li>
							<li>RecipeDef/MakeAB_GlowstoolSeedBundleDoubleCost</li>
						</value>
					</li>
				</operations>
			</li>
		</operations>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
